WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.539
Rectangles have four right angles and equal opposite sides. A square also has four

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:06.301
equal sides.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:12.166
How many right angles does a rectangle have? The answer is 4. Every rectangle has

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:13.175
four right angles.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:19.808
A rectangle during a reading competition is 9 cm long and 15 cm wide. Which pairs of

00:00:19.808 --> 00:00:22.865
sides have equal lengths? Pause the video and think.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.214
A rectangle during a reading competition is 9 cm long and 15 cm wide. Which pairs of

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:34.080
sides have equal lengths? The answer is opposite sides. The two long sides are equal

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.351
and the two short sides are equal.
